{
    "comment": "쇼핑몰 설정 — 환불 사유 목록, 좁은 화면용 카드. 넓은 화면용 표(`_refund_reason_section`)와\n  같은 배열을 편집한다.\n  \n  사유는 고객이 환불을 신청할 때 고르는 항목이고, **누가 부담하는가**(사유 종류)가 함께 붙어\n  있어 배송비 정산이 달라진다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "환불 사유 관리 - Mobile 카드 뷰"
    },
    "id": "refund_reason_cards_container",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "refund_reason_card_{{rIdx}}",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "iteration": {
                "source": "(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons ?? []).map((r, i) => ({...r, _idx: i}))",
                "item_var": "reason",
                "index_var": "rIdx"
            },
            "props": {
                "className": "excel-card mb-3"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "excel-card-header"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-center gap-2 min-w-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "min-w-0"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "{{_local.errors?.['claim.refund_reasons.' + reason._idx + '.code'] ? 'excel-card-title font-mono text-red-600 dark:text-red-400' : 'excel-card-title font-mono'}}"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{reason.code}}"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "PC 표와 같은 행 지목 통로 — 모바일에서만 코드 거절 사유가 사라지지 않게.",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{_local.errors?.['claim.refund_reasons.' + reason._idx + '.code']}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-error"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{_local.errors?.['claim.refund_reasons.' + reason._idx + '.code']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-center gap-2 shrink-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "Toggle",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "사용 여부. 끄면 고객 화면의 선택지에서 빠지고, 이미 그 사유로 접수된 건에는 영향이 없다.",
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "form.claim.refund_reasons": "{{(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons ?? []).map((r, i) => i === reason._idx ? {...r, is_active: !(r.is_active)} : r)}}",
                                                "hasChanges": true
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "checked": "{{reason.is_active ?? false}}",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "excel-card-body"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "excel-card-row"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "excel-card-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.columns.name"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "excel-card-value flex-1"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "composite",
                                            "name": "MultilingualInput",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "사유 문구. 고객에게 그대로 보이므로 언어별로 넣는다.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "form.claim.refund_reasons": "{{(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons ?? []).map((r, i) => i === reason._idx ? {...r, name: $event.target.value} : r)}}",
                                                        "hasChanges": true
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "value": "{{reason.name ?? {}}}",
                                                "layout": "compact",
                                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.form.name_ko_placeholder",
                                                "error": "{{_local.errors?.['claim.refund_reasons.' + reason._idx + '.name.' + (_global.appConfig?.siteLocale ?? $locale ?? 'ko')]?.[0] ?? _local.errors?.['claim.refund_reasons.' + reason._idx + '.name']?.[0] ?? ''}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "excel-card-row"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "excel-card-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.columns.fault_type"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "excel-card-value flex-1"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Select",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "사유 종류(귀책). 배송비를 누가 부담하는지가 여기서 갈린다.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "form.claim.refund_reasons": "{{(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons ?? []).map((r, i) => i === reason._idx ? {...r, fault_type: $event.target.value} : r)}}",
                                                        "hasChanges": true
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "value": "{{reason.fault_type ?? 'customer'}}",
                                                "className": "w-full",
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                                "options": [
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "customer",
                                                        "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.form.fault_types.customer"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "seller",
                                                        "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.form.fault_types.seller"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "carrier",
                                                        "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.form.fault_types.carrier"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "excel-card-row"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "excel-card-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.columns.is_user_selectable"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "excel-card-value"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "고객이 직접 고를 수 있는 사유인지. 끄면 관리자만 이 사유를 지정할 수 있다.",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "form.claim.refund_reasons": "{{(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons ?? []).map((r, i) => i === reason._idx ? {...r, is_user_selectable: !(r.is_user_selectable)} : r)}}",
                                                        "hasChanges": true
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "checkbox",
                                                "checked": "{{reason.is_user_selectable ?? false}}",
                                                "className": "checkbox",
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "excel-card-footer"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "사유 삭제.",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "form.claim.refund_reasons": "{{(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons ?? []).filter((_, i) => i !== reason._idx)}}",
                                        "form.claim.refund_reasons_deleted": "{{[...(_local.form?.claim?.refund_reasons_deleted ?? []), ...(reason?.id ? [reason.id] : [])]}}",
                                        "hasChanges": true
                                    },
                                    "confirm": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.claim.refund_reasons.confirm_delete"
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "p-1.5 text-gray-400 hover:text-red-600 dark:text-gray-500 dark:hover:text-red-400 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-900/20 rounded transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                "title": "$t:common.delete",
                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "fa-solid fa-trash",
                                        "className": "text-sm"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
